# Hierarchy: 5 = Animal; 22 = Dog (subtype of 5); 9 = Beagle (subtype of Dog).
# The path_A edge sharpens %object_A to 22; %object_B recovers to 9 through its
# own field. With per-incoming edge sharpening the phi is meet(22, 9) = 22 and
# the dependent field is 31; without it the phi is meet(5, 9) = 5 and the field
# is 30 (both paths' callback entries are present so the RED run fails on CHECK
# lines rather than on a missing key).
